           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Is Logo Austin close to Copperfield?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. Logo Austin's office is at 7600 Chevy Chase Dr in North Austin, close to Copperfield. Most projects are still handled by phone, text and email for speed.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Can you add a Spanish tagline to my logo?",
