          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. Logo Austin can design your logo with an English, Spanish or bilingual tagline.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "How much does a custom logo cost for a Copperfield business?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Logo Austin charges $125 to $175 for a custom logo, with no upfront payment. You pay only after approving the final design and receive JPG, PNG, SVG, PDF, AI and EPS files.</p>",
